&CONTROL OFF
CP SET RUN ON
&IF &$ EQ TEST CP SET RUN OFF
CP DEFINE READER 099
CP CLOSE 099 HOLD
CP SPOOL 099 CLASS I HOLD
CP PURGE READER CLASS I
CP PURGE READER CLASS L
CP SPOOL PUNCH TO * CLASS I CONT NOHOLD PURGE
CP SPOOL PRINTER TO * CLASS L
PUNCH DMKLD00E LOADER * (NOHEADER)
* NOTE THAT CPWNUC MUST BE THE FIRST DECK LOADED.
PUNCH CPWSUP TEXT *
&IF &$ EQ TEST &PUNCH  SPB
PUNCH CPWDSP TEXT *
&IF &$ EQ TEST &PUNCH  SPB
PUNCH CPWUSR TEXT *
&IF &$ EQ TEST &PUNCH  SPB
PUNCH CPWDEV TEXT *
&IF &$ EQ TEST &PUNCH  SPB
PUNCH CPWSYS TEXT *
&IF &$ EQ TEST &PUNCH  SPB
PUNCH CPWMAN TEXT *
PUNCH CPWASM TEXT *
* NOTE THAT CPWEND MUST BE THE LAST DECK LOADED.
&IF &$ EQ TEST &PUNCH  SPB
PUNCH CPWEND TEXT *
&BEGPUNCH
 LDT            CPWINT
&END
CP SPOOL PUNCH NOCONT
CP CLOSE PUNCH NAME &0 IPLDECK
CP SPOOL PUNCH OFF CLASS A
&CONTROL ALL
CP SP P CL Z
CP IPL 099 CLEAR
&EXIT 0 (HAH).

